    moves_generate_lattices hθ hSg hTg hcS hcT hW hSd hSd' hTd hTd' he hs hs' hx₀ hy₀ hmove hH rd P hrd d1 d2 r2 hsd₂ hα₁ hα₂
      hidx hf t1.2 t2.2 n2
